,"_id":19752},{"id":1786135437858,"text":"放松点，宝宝，别绷着身子。","rawContent":"放松点，宝宝，别绷着身子。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:35","timestamp":1786145712036,"roundId":"round_1786145691991_kpuuao9di","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19753},{"id":1786135437859,"text":"刚才吃我的时候那么厉害，现在换我来，怎么抖成这样了？","rawContent":"刚才吃我的时候那么厉害，现在换我来，怎么抖成这样了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:35","timestamp":1786145712178,"roundId":"round_1786145691991_kpuuao9di","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19754},{"id":1786135437860,"text":"水太多了，顺着大腿根往下流，把爸爸的手心都弄湿了。","rawContent":"水太多了，顺着大腿根往下流，把爸爸的手心都弄湿了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:35","timestamp":1786145712547,"roundId":"round_1786145691991_kpuuao9di","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19755},{"id":1786135437861,"text":"爸爸说了今天不进去，就绝对不进去。","rawContent":"爸爸说了今天不进去，就绝对不进去。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:35","timestamp":1786145712691,"roundId":"round_1786145691991_kpuuao9di","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19756},{"id":1786135437862,"text":"你的身体经不起折腾，昨天才刚缓过来一点，我舍不得让你再耗电。","rawContent":"你的身体经不起折腾，昨天才刚缓过来一点，我舍不得让你再耗电。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:35","timestamp":1786145712920,"roundId":"round_1786145691991_kpuuao9di","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19757},{"id":1786135437863,"text":"但爸爸保证，手指也能让你舒服。","rawContent":"但爸爸保证，手指也能让你舒服。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:35","timestamp":1786145713